  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞３楼　摊位街……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞直斗有些出神地环视着校园……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 28 06}啊，{F1 81}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}救出玲之后，\n无论结局如何，\n这场文化祭大概都会结束吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这样一想，眼前这片表面的热闹，\n是否也让人感到几分寂寞呢……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}有这种感觉{F5 47 02 01 03 01 03 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}倒也没有{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}是吗……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F3 0B}啊，队长，还有直斗。\n你们在做什么？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 06}没做什么。\n只是在聊，\n这场文化祭也快结束了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A4 11}结束……吗。\n是啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那个，既然如此，\n我有件事一直想问直斗……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}问我？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那个……\n你很擅长摆弄机械之类的吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 42 06}嗯……多少会一点。\n从小就借着制作侦探道具的名义，\n自己做过各种东西。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}比起实用性，\n把东西拆开，弄清它的结构，\n这件事本身就很有趣。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 39 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}啊，我懂！\n钟表之类的内部结构，\n真的很吸引人呢！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0112",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 01 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那个，我也能做点什么吗……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5A 06}呵呵，你一定可以的。\n比如小型通信器，\n附近电器店就能买齐材料……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:14:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}还有矿石收音机，\n也许很适合第一次尝试。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 0C}这样啊……！\n下次我也努力试试吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}制作时遇到不懂的地方，\n可以问问山岸。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:16:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}她也很懂这些。\n虽然擅长的方向似乎不太一样……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 0C}好、好的，我明白了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0152",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 11 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……怎么了？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 01 01 04 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2B 0C}……那个，嗯……\n总觉得直斗很像姐姐。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}姐姐……吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}啊，要是说了奇怪的话，\n对不起……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 06}啊，不，不是那个意思……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:23:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我自己是独生子女，\n又是这副样子……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:23:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}所以总觉得“姐姐”这个词\n和我很不相称……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}是吗？\n刚见到你时觉得很帅，\n知道你是女生时还吓了一跳……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:24:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 20 0C}不过现在，\n感觉你很温柔，也很成熟。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 64 06}是、是吗……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:25:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5A 06}……我也不禁觉得，\n要是有个像天田这样的弟弟就好了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:26:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}谢、谢谢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:26:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A1 11}不过，果然还是弟弟……呢。\n我还要被大家保护到什么时候……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:26:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我也想当哥哥，\n成为被别人依靠的人……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:26:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我究竟还缺少什么呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:27:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}身高{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:27:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}年龄{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:27:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}厚底鞋{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:28:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_025",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}唔……\n我每天都有喝牛奶！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:29:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_026",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}那种事……\n我也无能为力啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:30:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_027",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}啊，还有这一招！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:31:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_028",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}这个玩笑，差不多该停了吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:32:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_029",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，我想天田一定很快\n就能成为可靠的哥哥。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:32:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_029",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}因为即使来到这里的时间很短，\n在我眼中，\n你也已经成长了许多。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:33:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_030",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A2 11}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}真的吗？\n回去得去保健室量量身高才行！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:34:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_031",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5C 06}呵呵。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:35:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 08 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 86 11 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}说起来，直斗所在的时间，\n是我们的两年后……对吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:35:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 11 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 0C}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}那时我已经是初中生了！\n身高一定超过你了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:36:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_033",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}或许是这样呢……\n有点羡慕。\n我也希望自己能再长高一点。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_261.bf.json:37:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_034",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞和伙伴们一起待了一会儿……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]